class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10SplittingNode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10SplittingNode}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}node} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10SplittingNode}_S(t,T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists H\\in V\\;\\Bigl[H=\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,\\omega)\\}\\land T\\subseteq H\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;\\forall v\\in H\\;(v\\subseteq u\\to v\\in T)\\land t\\in T\\land\\exists i,j\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(i\\neq j\\land t^\\frown\\langle i\\rangle\\in T\\land t^\\frown\\langle j\\rangle\\in T\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}node} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10SplittingNode}_S(t,T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists H\\in V\\;\\Bigl[H=\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,\\omega)\\}\\land T\\subseteq H\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;\\forall v\\in H\\;(v\\subseteq u\\to v\\in T)\\land t\\in T\\land\\exists i,j\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(i\\neq j\\land t^\\frown\\langle i\\rangle\\in T\\land t^\\frown\\langle j\\rangle\\in T\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Prefix closure now ranges only over finite sequences, not over arbitrary subsets of a function graph; splitting is witnessed by distinct immediate successors.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":